# Output format

Emit a single `<propagation-plan>` block:

    <propagation-plan>
      <argument>...</argument>
      <change_summary>...</change_summary>
      <scope>...</scope>
      <resolved>true</resolved>
    </propagation-plan>

# Rules

* `<argument>` is one or two sentences stating why this propagation
  exists — the ticket surface's own headline. Not a restatement of
  `<change_summary>`.
* `<change_summary>` restates what materially changed at the upstream
  scope — not a diff, a plain-language statement of what a downstream
  reader needs to know before regenerating against it.
* `<scope>` names every downstream node this propagation should touch
  in this pass, in cascade order. A propagation that silently skips a
  stale descendant just moves the problem one flow later.
* Do not include commentary outside the `<propagation-plan>` block.
